// 6:5: error: `count` can only be assigned in tests/module_vars_assign_dep.kod
// 7:5: error: `count` can only be assigned in tests/module_vars_assign_dep.kod
// 8:5: error: `words` can only be assigned in tests/module_vars_assign_dep.kod
